OL,3,APope Leo hosts Bob Dylan at official
OL,4,Aresidence in Rome
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV hosted Bob Dylan at his
OL,7,Fofficial residence, the Apostolic
OL,8,FPalace, on Wednesday during the Rome
OL,9,Fstop on the singer-songwriter's Italian
OL,10,Ftour.
OL,12,FDylan, 85, wore a nearly all-black
OL,13,Foutfit, including a pulled up hoodie,
OL,14,Fgloves and umbrella, starkly
OL,15,Fcontrasting with the Chicago-born
OL,16,FPope's all-white vestments.
OL,18,FThe meeting between the pair, who both
OL,19,Fhail from the US Midwest, was brief,
OL,20,Faccording to Vatican News.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
