OL,3,APope Leo hosts Bob Dylan at official
OL,4,Aresidence in Rome
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeo presented the Nobel laureate with a
OL,7,Frosary and Dylan gifted Leo a copy of
OL,8,Fhis autobiography, Chronicles: Volume
OL,9,FOne.
